OL,3,AUS bans DeepSeek AI from government use
OL,4,Aas tech tension with China continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has ordered all artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence (AI) technology from the
OL,8,FChinese firm DeepSeek to be removed
OL,9,Ffrom most government systems.
OL,11,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,12,F(DHS) has banned all use of DeepSeek
OL,13,Fwithin civilian government agencies,
OL,14,Fand any technology built with the aid
OL,15,Fof its AI models.
OL,17,FAs a powerful AI model that is open
OL,18,Fsource - meaning it is free to access
OL,19,Fand less expensive to use - DeepSeek
OL,20,Fhas been seen as a disruptive force in
OL,21,Fthe ongoing AI technology race.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
