OL,3,ACNN anchor Christiane Amanpour to leave
OL,4,Anetwork after 43 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN's chief international anchor,
OL,7,FChristiane Amanpour, has announced she
OL,8,Fwill leave the organisation next year
OL,9,Fafter more than four decades.
OL,11,F"After many months of thought and a few
OL,12,Fsleepless nights, I have decided to
OL,13,Fseparate from CNN, my partner of 43
OL,14,Ffantastic years!" Amanpour said in a
OL,15,Fstatement.
OL,17,FThe 68-year-old said she "looks forward
OL,18,Fto interesting new projects down the
OL,19,Fline, and will always be rooting for
OL,20,FCNN and maintaining its history of
OL,21,Findependent journalism. Remember:
OL,22,Falways be truthful, not neutral".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
