OL,3,ACNN anchor Christiane Amanpour to leave
OL,4,Anetwork after 43 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN chairman Mark Thompson described
OL,7,Fher as "one of the most trusted and
OL,8,Fbeloved journalists anywhere" and said
OL,9,Fthe network will take time to celebrate
OL,10,Fher "before she departs next year".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
